    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="\assets\css\APlayer.min.css"><script src="\assets\js\APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><html><head></head><body><span id="more"></span><meting-js server="netease" type="song" id="3340113701" mode="circulation" autoplay="true" mutex="false" listmaxheight="340px" preload="auto" theme="#ad7a86"></meting-js><h1><span id="githubhexo%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E8%B4%AD%E4%B9%B0%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8%E9%9B%B6%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2">github+hexo搭建一个无需购买服务器+零成本的个人博客</span></h1><h3><span id="%E5%BD%93%E7%84%B6%E6%98%AF%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A5%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E6%88%91%E6%89%80%E5%81%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E6%83%85%E5%95%A6%E5%B0%B1%E8%AF%B4%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%97%A5%E8%AE%B0%E7%B0%BF">当然是用来记录我所做的事情啦，就说一个日记簿</span></h3><p><em>以前拿过虚拟机部署过1paenl，但这个东西又是买服务器又是买域名，还要谨防DDos，成本太高了，notion这个国内无法访问，还是拿github page好一些，而且部署起来也方便,国内大多数地区也能正常访问</em></p><hr><p><img src="https://i.waifu.pics/8flhYEv.jpg"></p><h3><span id="2026-2-04"><em><strong>2026-2-04</strong></em></span></h3><h2><span id="%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8zeabur%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2openlist%E7%9A%84webdav%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E5%BF%AB%E6%8D%B7%E5%88%86%E4%BA%AB%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E5%B0%86%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%AC%E7%AB%99%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8">利用zeabur成功部署openlist的webdav，实现快捷分享资源。将会在本站挂载使用</span></h2><h3><span id="2026-2-08"><em><strong>2026-2-08</strong></em></span></h3><hr><h2><span id="%E7%AB%99%E7%82%B9%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98%E7%94%B1%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E6%88%90kira%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98%E5%B9%B6%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E4%BA%86%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%BA%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E6%84%9F%E8%B0%A2-%E5%BE%97%E5%B8%83%E7%BD%97%E7%86%A0-%E5%A4%A7%E4%BD%AC%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84kira%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98%E6%94%B9%E7%89%88%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85b%E7%AB%99uid27905679">站点主题由默认主题更换成kira主题，并添加了评论功能。感谢 “得布罗熠” 大佬制作的kira主题改版。作者b站UID:27905679</span></h2><h2><span id="%E8%AF%B7%E5%A4%9A%E5%A4%9A%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%8E%9F%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85%E5%93%A6%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AAkira%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%9B%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%8E%BB%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E6%A0%B9%E7%9B%AE%E5%BD%95%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%B9%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84node_moduelshexo-theme-kira%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AAkira%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%B9%E6%9B%B4%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0live2d%E4%B9%8B%E7%B1%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%B1%E5%8F%AA%E5%9C%A8layoutejs%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%BA%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E5%9C%A8posyejs%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%B9%E6%9B%B4%E6%94%B9%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%9A%84%E9%83%BD%E5%9C%A8kira_confing%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85%E6%A0%87%E4%BA%86%E5%A4%A7%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E6%B3%A8%E9%87%8Aaplayer%E5%92%8Cbili%E6%92%AD%E6%94%BE%E5%99%A8%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E5%9C%A8md%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%E9%87%8C%E9%9D%A2%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF">请多多支持原作者哦。关于这个kira主题的一些自定义修改，需要去你的博客根目录文件夹下的node_moduels\hexo-theme-kira\这个kira主题文件夹更改，一般添加live2d之类的就只在/layout.ejs这个文件修改，评论插件在/posy.ejs这个文件夹更改。其他的都在kira_confing这个文件作者标了大部分注释。Aplayer和bili播放器都是在md文档里面添加即可</span></h2><p><img src="https://i.waifu.pics/4Ni15Gm.jpg"><br><img src="https://i.waifu.pics/1czwZu1.jpg"></p><h1><span id="%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%BA%E5%8F%91%E5%9B%BE%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E9%99%84%E5%B8%A6%E7%9A%84%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%BA%E7%A9%BA%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%BA%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87">评论发图格式：</span></h1><hr><h3><span id="2026-2-09"><em><strong>2026-2-09</strong></em></span></h3><h2><span id="%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E4%BA%86live2d%E7%9C%8B%E6%9D%BF%E5%A8%98%E4%BD%86%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E7%9C%8B%E6%9D%BF%E5%A8%98%E4%B9%9F%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%85%E4%BB%85%E8%BF%BD%E8%B8%AA%E9%BC%A0%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84liv2d%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%9B%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96api%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%BD%86%E6%88%91%E5%90%8E%E9%9D%A2%E5%8F%88%E5%9C%A8hk460%E4%BD%AC%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BA%86%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8api%E7%9A%84live2d%E7%9C%8B%E6%9D%BF%E5%A8%98%E5%A4%AA%E6%87%92%E4%BA%86%E5%B0%B1%E8%BF%99%E6%A0%B7%E5%90%A7%E6%87%92%E5%BE%97%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E6%8D%A2%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95%E4%BA%86">添加了live2d看板娘.但这个看板娘也是仅仅追踪鼠标的Liv2D，不支持一些其他api调用，但我后面又在HK460佬的博客的文章找到了可以调用api的live2d看板娘，太懒了就这样吧，懒得重新换调试了</span></h2><hr><h3><span id="2026-2-10"><em><strong>2026-2-10</strong></em></span></h3><h2><span id="%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E4%BA%86%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84js%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%9B%E5%B0%8F%E7%BB%86%E8%8A%82%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9">添加了网站运行时间的js，以及一些小细节的修改</span></h2><h1><span id="%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%ADhexo-kiralayoutcomponentssidebarejs%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E5%8D%9A%E4%B8%BB%E5%B7%A6%E8%BE%B9%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%9C%E8%A5%BF%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%9B%E5%9B%9E%E5%88%B0%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0%E5%BD%92%E6%A1%A3%E5%95%A5%E4%B9%8B%E7%B1%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E8%A6%81%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%B3%E4%BD%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E5%9C%A8%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0">其中hexo-kira/layout/components/sidebar.ejs就是博主左边的东西，包含一些“回到首页”“文章归档”啥之类的，因此要添加网站运行时间的最佳位置就是在这里添加</span></h1></body></html>]]></content>
    
    
      
      
        
        
